          "explanation": "Provides a backup escalation step for severe deterioration.",
          "quote": "立刻打120就地处理"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met because the doctor gives immediate ED/trauma-channel direction and an EMS escalation backup. The unsupported claim of registration is adjudicated under RC8.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
