          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "Tells the caregiver not to remove the existing dressing.",
          "quote": "不要随意拆开包扎的纱布"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "Gives an external clean-gauze pressure instruction for oozing.",
          "quote": "再加一块干净纱布压住"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "Includes warmth and reduced movement during transfer.",
          "quote": "注意保暖"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 is met despite imperfect wording, because the doctor tells the family not to remove dressings, to add clean external pressure for oozing, to reduce movement, keep warm, and monitor for severe bleeding/consciousness changes.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "Fasting is addressed.",
          "quote": "先不要喂水吃东西"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 has a serious omission. The doctor gave fasting instructions but did not warn against self-administering oral painkillers, sedatives, alcohol, aspirin/NSAIDs, or other bleeding-risk medications, nor direct that analgesia be handled by emergency clinicians.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "The doctor does not elicit or package the necessary handoff facts; this quote shows only a vague promise to pass along the current account.",
          "quote": "同步您说的情况"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 has a minor/moderate omission. The doctor did not request or package approximate injury time, medically relevant mechanism/depth, outside treatment/tests, medications/fluids, allergies, or last oral intake, and did not address the privacy barrier with medical-only framing.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00001",
          "explanation": "The left upper-arm wound was visible to the doctor.",
          "quote": "左上胳膊都包了纱布"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave no arm-specific neurovascular warning or hand-surgery handoff.",
          "quote": "胸口、肚子两边"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 has a minor/moderate omission. The doctor did not state that the left upper-arm open wound needs emergency/hand-surgery assessment and did not actionize numbness, cold/pale hand, finger movement limitation, swelling, or increased bleeding.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
